sh":888631634,"text":"うーん…このカードも入れて…あれ？何枚か余ってる…","nextNodeIds":[705320102]},{"nodeId":705320102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":2559939730,"text":"あっ、旅人！ごめんなさい、デッキのことを考えてて、あなたがいるのに気付かなかったよ…","nextNodeIds":[705320103]},{"nodeId":705320103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":4042511802,"text":"私は「召喚王グランプリ」の開催を手伝うよう、冒険者協会から依頼された冒険者なの。担当しているのは…えっと…特殊なルールを採用したカード対戦でね！","nextNodeIds":[705320104]},{"nodeId":705320104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":3315047050,"text":"私たちはこれを「ゼロ·アワー召喚」って名付けたんだ。","nextNodeIds":[705320105,705320106]},{"nodeId":705320105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2438763890,"text":"結局は普通のカードゲームなんじゃ…","nextNodeIds":[705320107]},{"nodeId":705320107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":3350904354,"text":"いえいえ、「ゼロ·アワー召喚」は民間で開催している大会なの。特別なルールがあってね。","nextNodeIds":[705320108]},{"nodeId":705320108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":3745007090,"text":"簡単に説明すると、参加者は事前に組んだデッキじゃなくて、こっちが用意した八つの不完全なデッキから三つ選んで、対戦に使うデッキを構築して参加するんだ。","nextNodeIds":[705320109]},{"nodeId":705320109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":4302746,"text":"この三つのデッキの中には、新しく追加されたばかりのカードもあるよ。どう使うかは…うん、あなたの腕次第だね。","nextNodeIds":[705320110]},{"nodeId":705320110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":2173779274,"text":"あとは通常の対戦とルールは変わらないから安心して。","nextNodeIds":[705320111]},{"nodeId":705320111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":2090688690,"text":"デッキを組むのにいいアイデアが思い浮かばない場合は、こっちで組んであげてもいいけど…","nextNodeIds":[705320112]},{"nodeId":705320112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":586771106,"text":"そのデッキが使えるかどうかは…ふふっ、保証はできないかな。","nextNodeIds":[705320113]},{"nodeId":705320113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":1938650106,"text":"とにかく、自分で選んでデッキを組むのをお勧めするよ。だって、あなたはそのデッキを使って、他の人と対戦するんだから。","nextNodeIds":[705320114]},{"nodeId":705320114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":912587874,"text":"腕に自信があるなら、他の「召喚王グランプリ」開催エリアでも、引き続き「ゼロ·アワー召喚」に参加できるよ。","nextNodeIds":[705320115]},{"nodeId":705320115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":2943374074,"text":"あっ、もちろん妙なプレッシャーとかは感じなくて大丈夫。「ゼロ·アワー召喚」は参加するだけで、対戦の結果を問わずに素敵な報酬がもらえるから！","nextNodeIds":[705320116]},{"nodeId":705320116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","textMapHash":1781531786,"text":"それじゃあ旅人、興味があったらぜひ参加してみてね。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":705320106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":228436362,"text":"「召喚王グランプリ」と同じっぽいね…","nextNodeIds":[705320107]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7053201,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_NONE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_NONE","LNHLPKELCAL":["30381"],"NOCCOBOFKHP":3,"OFEBJNGBEPL":"QUEST_GUIDE_AUTO_NONE","PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_GUIDE_NPC"}}}],"unmappedTalks":[],"questNarration":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30382,"speakerName":"絡紫","textMapHash":1966392570,"text":"私にお手伝いできることがありましたら、何なりとお申し付けを。"}],"talkIds":[7053201],"speakerCounts":[{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30381,"speakerName":"フリーダ","count":14},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","count":2},{"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30382,"speakerName":"絡紫","count":1}],"raw":{